        "AbstractText": "This paper demonstrates the first highly chemoselective syntheses of various borasiloxanes from hydroboranes and silanols, achieved through catalyst-free dehydrogenative coupling at room temperature. This green protocol, which uses easily accessible reagents, allows for the obtaining of borasiloxanes under air atmosphere and solvent-free conditions."
